This project was sparked by work on crm-cli (https://github.com/jdanielnd/crm-cli,
MIT-licensed), a local-first terminal CRM. mdql generalizes the markdown-graph
engine that made crm-cli's storage layer interesting — atomic frontmatter writes,
slug-addressed [[wiki]] links, and a Bleve-backed FTS + backlink index — into a
schema-driven framework that is no longer tied to any particular domain. Credit
to @jdanielnd for the original idea.

